    "With an addon chosen, Auto Pick starts as soon as that addon has a stream it can play, from everything that has arrived by then. If that addon fails, has nothing to play, or doesn't cover the title, Auto Pick waits for every addon, as before. Auto waits for the fastest addon that answers reliably and finds the sharpest streams; with nothing tested yet, it waits for every addon.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With an addon chosen, Auto Pick starts as soon as that addon has a stream it can play, from everything that has arrived by then. If that addon fails, has nothing to play, or doesn't cover the title, Auto Pick waits for every addon, as before. Auto waits for the fastest addon that answers reliably and finds the sharpest streams; with nothing tested yet, it waits for every addon."
          }
        }
      }
    },
